  description: "Target up to 3 \"Mathmech\" monsters in your GY with different names,
    then activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF Special Summon them, but their effects
    are negated, then, immediately after this effect resolves, Synchro Summon 1 \"Mathmech\"
    Synchro Monster using only those monsters, and shuffle the materials into the
    Deck instead of sending them to the GY.\r\n\u25CF Special Summon them, but their
    effects are negated, then, immediately after this effect resolves, Xyz Summon
    1 \"Mathmech\" Xyz Monster using only those monsters.\r\nYou can only activate
    1 \"Mathmech Superfactorial\" per turn."
